sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as API
    participant D as Database
    U->>B: Click sign in
    B->>+A: POST /login
    A->>D: SELECT user
    D-->>A: row
    Note right of A: bcrypt compare
    A-->>-B: 200 + session cookie
    B-->>U: Show dashboard
    loop every 5 minutes
        B->>A: Refresh token
    end
